The remedy text directly targets both failure modes present in this incident: (1) delivering a rewrite when one wasn't requested ("Do not rewrite, rebuild, or expand adjacent components") and (2) not using the specified workspace/path ("do not work outside the specified location"). It also prescribes the correct alternative behavior (ask before expanding scope) rather than just naming the problem.

